  m_Text: "\u2022 Alt\u0131n renkli d\xFC\u015Fmanlar <b>elit</b>tir, daha \xE7ok \xF6d\xFCl verir.\n\u2022 Toplad\u0131\u011F\u0131n alt\u0131nla <b>D\xFCkkan</b>'dan kal\u0131c\u0131 g\xFC\xE7 al.\n\u2022 Bir silah\u0131n iki y\xFCkseltmesini doldur: <b>EVR\u0130M!</b>"
